OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F315A1787071694
OL,3,C'It's football, not PlayStation': Top
OL,4,CUefa referee calls for VAR change
OL,6,FUefa's top referee has called for a
OL,7,Fchange in the use of video assistant
OL,8,Freferee (VAR), criticising the focus
OL,9,Fon "microscopic situations" that do
OL,10,Fnot consider the wider context.
OL,12,FUefa referees' chief Roberto Rosetti
OL,13,Fsaid: "We realise that everywhere now
OL,14,Fthere is not any satisfaction about
OL,15,Fhow VAR is impacting football.
OL,17,F"So we want to avoid microscopic
OL,18,Fsituations. The context is super
OL,19,Fimportant. It's football, not
OL,20,FPlayStation. We need to be very, very
OL,21,Fcareful."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
