FL,316,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F315A1787071694
OL,3,C'It's football, not PlayStation': Top
OL,4,CUefa referee calls for VAR change
OL,6,FHe was speaking as Uefa launched a new
OL,7,Fservice called Clear Line, which will
OL,8,Fhighlight to referees and fans when
OL,9,FVAR should and should not be used.
OL,11,FThe platform is set to offer guidance
OL,12,Fon how the rules of the game should be
OL,13,Finterpreted, along with VAR
OL,14,Fintervention to bring a more
OL,15,Fconsistent application of decisions.
OL,17,FUefa added that Clear Line has more
OL,18,Fthan 150 refereeing scenarios guiding
OL,19,Fon law interpretation and when VAR
OL,20,Fshould or should not intervene at both
OL,21,Fdomestic and Uefa competition level.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,316,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F315A1787071694
OL,3,C'It's football, not PlayStation': Top
OL,4,CUefa referee calls for VAR change
OL,6,FIt also reinforces that video review
OL,7,Fshould only be used for clear and
OL,8,Fobvious errors.
OL,10,FRosetti said: "Clear Line is designed
OL,11,Fto provide clear and precise guidance
OL,12,Fto match officials across European
OL,13,Ffootball, helping to ensure greater
OL,14,Fconsistency in decision-making across
OL,15,Fcompetitions and a more standardised
OL,16,Fapproach to the use of VAR for the
OL,17,Fbenefit of the game.
OL,26,@rD@OOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
