PN,31504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F315A1787071694
OL,3,C'It's football, not PlayStation': Top
OL,4,CUefa referee calls for VAR change
OL,6,F"While no two incidents are ever
OL,7,Fidentical and occasional mistakes
OL,8,Fremain inevitable, Clear Line will
OL,9,Fprovide a central reference point for
OL,10,Fplayers, coaches, commentators and
OL,11,Ffans, helping to explain the rationale
OL,12,Fbehind refereeing decisions and
OL,13,Fpromoting a greater understanding of
OL,14,Fthe decision-making process."
