OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F315A1787071694
OL,3,C'It's football, not PlayStation': Top
OL,4,CUefa referee calls for VAR change
OL,6,FVAR has been a constant source of
OL,7,Ffrustration for fans and teams since
OL,8,Fits introduction, and every major
OL,9,Ftournament it is put under the
OL,10,Fspotlight, with minuscule details that
OL,11,Fwould otherwise have gone unnoticed
OL,12,Fleading to decisions that can change
OL,13,Fthe game.
OL,15,FFans have complained that it breaks up
OL,16,Fthe game too much, while many senior
OL,17,Ffigures in the football world have
OL,18,Fcalled for it to be removed.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
