PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F315A1787071694
OL,3,C'It's football, not PlayStation': Top
OL,4,CUefa referee calls for VAR change
OL,6,FVAR remained controversial at the
OL,7,Frecent World Cup because of how often
OL,8,Fa decision was used to overturn a goal.
OL,10,FIn England's quarter-final against
OL,11,FNorway, a Norwegian goal was
OL,12,Fdisallowed after VAR identified an
OL,13,FErling Haaland push committed before
OL,14,Fthe preceding corner had even entered
OL,15,Fplay, prompting outrage from fans.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
