PN,31507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F315A1787071694
OL,3,C'It's football, not PlayStation': Top
OL,4,CUefa referee calls for VAR change
OL,6,FUefa is currently on the verge of
OL,7,Fboycotting the World Cup after being
OL,8,Fthe most vocal opponent of Fifa
OL,9,FPresident Gianni Infantino's plan to
OL,10,Finvite private investment into the
OL,11,Fcompetition.
OL,13,FUefa has also moved to welcome
OL,14,FSomalian referee Omar Artan, who is
OL,15,Fset to become the first non-European
OL,16,Fofficial to referee the Uefa Super Cup
OL,17,Fon Wednesday, as he will oversee the
OL,18,Fmatch between Paris Saint-Germain and
OL,19,FAston Villa in Salzburg.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
