PN,31508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F315A1787071694
OL,3,C'It's football, not PlayStation': Top
OL,4,CUefa referee calls for VAR change
OL,6,FHe was meant to referee a game during
OL,7,Fthe World Cup in the US, but was
OL,8,Fturned away by customs officials
OL,9,Fdespite having the right paperwork and
OL,10,Fan 11-hour interview.
OL,12,FSomalia is one of the nations whose
OL,13,Fnationals Donald Trump's
OL,14,Fadministration has heavily restricted
OL,15,Fentry to the US.
OL,17,FUS officials claimed Artan had
OL,18,Fconnections with suspected members of
OL,19,Fterror organisations at the time.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G8/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
