OL,3,C'It's football, not PlayStation': Top
OL,4,CUefa referee calls for VAR change
OL,6,FArtan has been praised for his
OL,7,Fprofessionalism and was the first
OL,8,Freferee from Somalia to oversee a CAF
OL,9,FChampions League final in 2025.
